Subject: [PATCH] clocksource: ingenic: support TCU variants and per-CPU interrupts
Upstream-Status: Pending

Add JZ4730 and X1600 TCU register, counter and clock-source variants across
the clock, timer and interrupt-controller drivers. Share timer channel
assignments with the interrupt controller for JZ4780 CPU affinity.

Describe the additional register layouts and binding constants, and use
the X1600 RTC clock mux as the watchdog clock parent.

